g for Don’s help to reunite her with her parents’ spirits. The two new friends then embark on an exciting adventure to help each other and learn the true meaning of friendship.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":844075,\"title\":\"New Gods: Yang Jian\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tW5dFOemV4d7hxTcVI2bu4u0C9z.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zxIXvhF5PSZwQ9tvlLIzhcwi7IO.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fifteen hundred years after the war of gods, the heaven declined. Yang Jian, the God of Erlang, made a living by working as a catcher. One day, Yang Jian was ordered to hunt down a young man, his own nephew.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":275602,\"title\":\"Mickey Mouse Clubhouse: Mickey's Great Clubhouse Hunt\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4AUMclgbYQSt7FTvjLzj3PZahGN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fA5UpWikS3u333BOV8QPlGYxSOo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mickey and the gang are preparing for an Easter party; however, Pete says the password incorrectly, blowing the clubhouse away, and Mickey must travel far and wide to get it together again.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":850818,\"title\":\"Barbie: Big City, Big Dreams\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jeggetf6lrd0dhtcbqJH75Sik4K.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xcQvASZeumuejolgofKDYDqhQo8.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Barbie meets another Barbie Roberts, forming a close friendship, nicknaming each other Malibu and Brooklyn when they both attend the Handlers, Performing Art School in NYC, over the summer, competing for a spot at the spotlight solo.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Music\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5255,\"title\":\"The Polar